{"4708030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hamstr Protocol", "steam_appid": 4708030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamstr Protocol</strong> is a first-person bio-mining simulator. You mine HAM - a digital currency powered not by electricity, but by hamsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own <strong>hamster-powered</strong> mining operation and turn a small setup into a thriving bio-mining empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/14d7c320106966a9ec72057a1bcf73c4.poster.avif?t=1788273788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/14d7c320106966a9ec72057a1bcf73c4.webm?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/14d7c320106966a9ec72057a1bcf73c4.mp4?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br> Experience tactile, first-person interaction. Pick up, carry, and place every piece of hardware by hand. Every component matters in your quest for the ultimate mining setup.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCALE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/931ce0d1ce9f7750e9b3a04911e84bba.poster.avif?t=1788273788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/931ce0d1ce9f7750e9b3a04911e84bba.webm?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/931ce0d1ce9f7750e9b3a04911e84bba.mp4?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br> The more you scale, the harder it gets to keep everything under control. Manage heat, noise, and hunger as you expand your underground facility into a massive bio-mining network.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIQUIDATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/49b2cc1c5fbd1cc552289a129ec93417.poster.avif?t=1788273788\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/49b2cc1c5fbd1cc552289a129ec93417.webm?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/49b2cc1c5fbd1cc552289a129ec93417.mp4?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br>Money never sleeps. Use your in-game ATM to track market trends and trade your HAM for USD at the terminal. Reinvest your profits to break the system or save up for the next big upgrade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamster-powered rigs</strong> - Mount runners on wheels and attach high-end GPUs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thermal management </strong>- Heat is your biggest enemy. Cool your rigs or lose your hardware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile Management</strong> - A deep first-person simulation where you handle every asset manually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Ecosystem</strong> - Manage your entire operation through a fully functional in-game PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something doesn't add up</strong> - But that's a problem for later.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamstr Protocol</strong> is a first-person bio-mining simulator. You mine HAM - a digital currency powered not by electricity, but by hamsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own <strong>hamster-powered</strong> mining operation and turn a small setup into a thriving bio-mining empire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/14d7c320106966a9ec72057a1bcf73c4.poster.avif?t=1788273788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/14d7c320106966a9ec72057a1bcf73c4.webm?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/14d7c320106966a9ec72057a1bcf73c4.mp4?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br> Experience tactile, first-person interaction. Pick up, carry, and place every piece of hardware by hand. Every component matters in your quest for the ultimate mining setup.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCALE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/931ce0d1ce9f7750e9b3a04911e84bba.poster.avif?t=1788273788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/931ce0d1ce9f7750e9b3a04911e84bba.webm?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/931ce0d1ce9f7750e9b3a04911e84bba.mp4?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br> The more you scale, the harder it gets to keep everything under control. Manage heat, noise, and hunger as you expand your underground facility into a massive bio-mining network.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIQUIDATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/49b2cc1c5fbd1cc552289a129ec93417.poster.avif?t=1788273788\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/49b2cc1c5fbd1cc552289a129ec93417.webm?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708030/extras/49b2cc1c5fbd1cc552289a129ec93417.mp4?t=1788273788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><br><br>Money never sleeps. Use your in-game ATM to track market trends and trade your HAM for USD at the terminal. Reinvest your profits to break the system or save up for the next big upgrade.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamster-powered rigs</strong> - Mount runners on wheels and attach high-end GPUs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thermal management </strong>- Heat is your biggest enemy. Cool your rigs or lose your hardware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactile Management</strong> - A deep first-person simulation where you handle every asset manually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Ecosystem</strong> - Manage your entire operation through a fully functional in-game PC.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something doesn't add up</strong> - But that's a problem for later.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "From a single hamster wheel to a full bio-mining operation: set up rigs, manage heat, feed your runners, and turn HAM into real in-game profit. Expand your setup, optimize your operation, and never let the hardware overheat.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America", "heade